sequenceDiagram
  actor Req as Requester
  actor Rev as Reviewer/Operator
  participant API as Product API
  participant CR as ChangeRequest Service
  participant EX as Execution Service
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant AD as Allowlisted Adapter

  Req->>API: create + submit change request
  API->>CR: persist reviewed request
  CR->>DB: request + review digest
  Rev->>API: approval decision
  API->>CR: bind decision to reviewed content
  CR->>DB: approval + status
  Rev->>API: POST execute + optional Idempotency-Key
  API->>EX: execute_change_request
  EX->>DB: check stop/approval/env/idempotency; create RUNNING + lease
  EX->>AD: execute bounded adapter
  alt adapter succeeds
    AD-->>EX: bounded output
    EX->>DB: SUCCEEDED + request COMPLETED + receipt + audit
  else adapter fails
    AD-->>EX: exception/non-zero result
    EX->>DB: FAILED + request FAILED + receipt + audit
  end
  EX-->>API: durable execution projection
  API-->>Rev: result